# Decode9 (2026-10-13): STRATA_MAC_PULL_SPLIT=S (a whole-blob read cut into S page-aligned pieces) and
# STRATA_D9_PRE_ASYNC=1 (a helper thread queues the gated y-push job while the Metal lane runs). Both measured no gain,
# default OFF; the code is part of the shipped engine source.
# Base: Strata v0.1.41 (fb58e0dbc839) + patches/strata/0001..0013, applied in order with `git apply -p1`.

diff --git a/src/core/expert_source.cpp b/src/core/expert_source.cpp
